e quit way sooner  so i understand that you're broken and  for anybody watching who you know didn't  write in and you're feeling the same way  this normal guys  this is normal businesses don't just  start up when they're hugely successful  and didn't have any problems along the  way it's normal to want to quit to give  up to feel broken  and i encourage you to really look  inside and think  about what you're doing and  understand is this what you love is this  something that you want to dedicate your  life to  if it's not then then find it  and it's scary and and and heartbreaking  and hard but when you find  what is right for you when you find your  path when you find the thing that makes  you come alive you'll feel so good  i promise you you know it's reminded me  of people who  if you break up with somebody right you  break up with somebody  who you know is not right for you but  you still feel like crap  right you feel like i'm not gonna find  anybody i'm not gonna  i'm so down on myself this isn't you  know how i thought i'd live my life  and you may even do desperate things you  may  you know just date the wrong person or  go crazy on online dating or whatever it  is you just do  crazy stupid things because you're  feeling so hurt  and so much in pain but when you do find  that right person  your life changes and you become really  happy and you feel  fulfilled the same thing happens in  business when you find that right  idea even though it's it may be painful  cause you a lot of stress and  you're not making money yet if it's  right for you if in your heart you know  this is what you're meant to do then you  have to find a way to keep going  maybe you're taking jobs on the side  whatever it is you have to find a way to  keep going and if you haven't found that  yet  keep searching your heart will know when  you found the right opportunity  believe for those who watching like the  video let me know please give it a  thumbs up it means a lot to me  let me know